cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this study, its code or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "ACT action chunking under delay and disturbance"
abstract: >-
  An evaluation of five ways to execute the action chunks of an ACT policy (full chunk, replanning
  every 50, 25 or 10 steps, and temporal ensembling) on the ALOHA transfer-cube task in simulation,
  under observation latency and mid-episode cube displacement, with two independently trained
  checkpoints and paired seeds.
